    "chunk_text": "\u00fe, wur\u00fea \u00feinne f\u00e6der & modor, & se \u00fee wyrg\u00f0 hys f\u00e6der & modor swelte se So\u00felice ge cwe\u00f0a\u00fe, swa hwylc swa seg\u00f0 hys f\u00e6der & meder, swa hwylc lac swa of me is frema\u00fe \u00fee. & ne wur\u00f0ia\u00fe f\u00e6der & modor & ge for naht dydon Godes bebod for eowre lage. La licceteras, wel be eow witegode Isaias se witega \u00fea he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00feis folc me mid welerum wur\u00fea\u00f0 & Butan intingan hig me wur\u00feia\u00fe & l\u00e6ra\u00f0 manna lara. & he \u00fea \u00f0am menegum tog\u00e6dere geclypedum \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, gehyra\u00f0 & ongyta\u00fe. Ne besmit \u00feone mann \u00fe\u00e6t on hys mu\u00fe g\u00e6\u00f0, ac hyne besmit \u00fe\u00e6t of hys mu\u00fee g\u00e6\u00fe. \u00dea geneal\u00e6hton hys leorningcnihtas & cw\u00e6don, wast \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea Fariseiscean synt gedrefede \u00feisum \u00dea andswarode he him, \u00e6lc plantung \u00fee min heofenlica F\u00e6der ne plantode by\u00fe awurtwalod. L\u00e6ta\u00f0 hi, hig synt blinde & blindra latteowas; Se blinda gyf he blindne l\u00e6t hig fealla\u00f0 begen on \u00d0a andswarode him Petrus, arece us \u00feis bigspell. \u00d0a andswarode he him, & synt ge gyt butan andgyte? Ne ongyte ge \u00fe\u00e6t eall \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00feone mu\u00fe g\u00e6\u00fe g\u00e6\u00fe on \u00fea wambe & by\u00fe on for\u00fegang asend? So\u00felice \u00fea \u00feing \u00fee of \u00feam mu\u00f0e ga\u00fe cuma\u00f0 of \u00fe\u00e6re heortan & \u00fea smita\u00fe \u00feone",
